<title>PHILIPPINES: Aboitiz buys back 17.32 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Aboitiz buys back 17.32 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aboitiz Equity Ventures Inc said on Tuesday it bought back 17.32 million of its own shares.</p>
<p>In a notice to the Philippine Stock Exchange, the company said the purchase was part of the company's buy-back scheme earlier approved by its board of directors.</p>
<p>Last month, AEV also bought close to 16.5 million of its own shares. Prior to that purchase, the firm bought 707,000 shares.</p>
<p>AEV is involved in the power generation, transportation and financial services sectors.</p>
<p>AEV was untraded in early morning session on Tuesday. On Monday, the issue closed unchanged at 1.90 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
